Package: LazymanScript
Title: Data Conversion and Identity Checking Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dr. Chia-Hsin", "Liu", email = "martin@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides utility functions to seamlessly convert clinical data tables between wide and long formats while preserving exact data types (numeric, character, logical). It also includes a robust identity checker to verify that data integrity is maintained during transformations.
